    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. so for the 'pro-repair' section of my script, i want to really drive home the idea that the current model is fundamentally broken. if you had to draft a closing statement for a segment that basically argues that tech companies have lost the moral right to control how we use our own property, how would you phrase that?",
